d love to see you there. Any kind of feedback—whether it’s what feels good or what could be tweaked—is super valuable to me during the development process.I'll leave the invite link below for anyone who wants to join. Also, if you'd like to sup","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:34:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041308","verified_at":"2026-10-25T11:27:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5049610-1843481262690013","game_id":"steam-5049610","kind":"announcement","title":"The Varitav - Demo Now Live!","summary":"Greetings!I have completed the core mechanics, designs, and biomes during the development of The Varitav, and the demo is OUT NOW!You can now experience the game firsthand and get a feel for its atmosphere and gameplay. Don't forget to share your experiences and feedback, and be sure to add The Varitav to your wishlist to show your support and stay updated on the latest news!Happy gaming, and see you soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T17:49:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690013","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5049610-1842212951307768","game_id":"steam-5049610","kind":"announcement","title":"The Varitav - Demo Coming Very Soon!","summary":"Hello,Development on The Varitav is proceeding at full speed. I’ve made significant progress on the game's core mechanics, designs, and biomes.I’ll be sharing the first playable demo with you very soon, so you can experience the game firsthand and get a feel for it. I’ll announce the exact demo release date in the coming days.Don't forget to add The Varitav to your wishlist to stay updated and show your support.See you soon!","occu